dsh-pavement-design-methods
============================

MIT licensed, with an explicit scope carve-out - see LICENSE. The MIT grant covers only the
material originated by this package's author. It does not cover, and does not purport to
cover, anything belonging to the source work.


Source work
-----------

    《路面设计原理与方法》（第 4 版）
    黄晓明、马涛 等 编著
    人民交通出版社股份有限公司，2021 年 8 月第 4 版（总第 13 次印刷）
    ISBN 978-7-114-17560-2，484 页，759 千字
    责任编辑：李瑞

    Chapters distilled: all nine — 1 概论, 2 车辆与交通, 3 气候与环境,
    4 路基路面材料特性, 5 沥青路面结构力学性能分析, 6 水泥混凝土路面力学性能分析,
    7 公路沥青路面设计方法, 8 公路水泥混凝土路面设计方法, 9 机场道面设计方法.


What this package is
--------------------

  * a structured paraphrase of the book's arguments, written in this package's own words, with
    page references so a reader can check every claim against the printed book;

  * an ERRATA REGISTER: roughly a hundred transcription defects, internal contradictions and
    numbering faults found while distilling the book are documented card by card, each with the
    page and, where possible, a recomputation. This register is this package's own contribution;

  * a boundary statement: the book's two highway design chapters contain no reproducible worked
    example, and its only complete hand calculation ends with a wrong verdict. The package says so
    rather than smoothing it over.


What this package is NOT
------------------------

  * it is not the book, and cannot substitute for it. Read the book;

  * it contains no verbatim passages. An automated audit against three source transcriptions found
    a longest shared run of zero characters across all 76 cards; the few ten-character matches that
    remain are chapter titles, the book title, and parameter-name pairs used as table labels, all
    registered as structural exemptions;

  * all formulas are marked unchecked against the printed page, and all numbers are marked as
    transcription values.  Every figure in the source book was lost in transcription; the cards say
    so where it matters.


Provenance note
---------------

The source PDF for this book was replaced during an earlier transcription: pages 393-495 came out as
unrelated textbook material, and chapters 8 (tail) and 9 were accordingly believed lost. Both were
recovered on 2026-10-24 by re-OCR of the original scan with a vision model, and the cards were
rewritten against the recovered text. The recovery, its evidence, and the residual limits are
documented in the skill's BOOK-MAP.md.

